chers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"Given a list of numbers by the user, this program will find the element the user is searching for.","topics":[],"score":227310,"global_rank":120194},{"name":"fabricekalvanda/shapes","owner":"fabricekalvanda","html_url":"https://github.com/fabricekalvanda/shapes","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"I have multiple shapes. Each shape does something different depending on what it is.","topics":[],"score":227310,"global_rank":120195},{"name":"fabricekalvanda/quilts","owner":"fabricekalvanda","html_url":"https://github.com/fabricekalvanda/quilts","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"I have a business that sells quilts of the same pattern, but different sizes depending on the customers needs. A customer is able to request a quilt with this pattern as big as they want.","topics":[],"score":227310,"global_rank":120196},{"name":"fabricekalvanda/diceGame","owner":"fabricekalvanda","html_url":"https://github.com/fabricekalvanda/diceGame","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"I have 2 die, 6 sided each I start the game and print the intro  \u201cHey! Welcome to Tina\u2019s Dice Game.\u201d \u201cLet\u2019s start!\u201d The computer randomly generates what side of the die is chosen (for each die) I then add both of the random numbers together  I then print  Dice 1 = (the random number I got)  Dice 2 = (the random number I got) Depending on what number I get, something different is printed to the screen If I get an even number  I print \u201cI got (value of dice 1) and (value of dice 2)!\u201d  I print \u201cEvens are better than odds!\u201d If I get an odd number I print \u201cI got (value of dice 1) and (value of dice 2)!\u201d  I print \u201cOdds are still cool!\u201d At the end, I ask the user if they want to play again If the answer is \u201cYES\u201d  I \u201cthrow\u201d the die again and repeat the printing process If the answer is anything but YES (case-sensitive) I end the game and print the outro  \u201cThe number of times the dice was thrown is: (value of times dice is thrown)\u201d \u201cNice game!\u201d \u201cThanks for playing, Come play again soon!\u201d\u2028","topics":[],"score":227310,"global_rank":120197},{"name":"UWJimP/project-p0","owner":"UWJimP","html_url":"https://github.com/UWJimP/project-p0","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":null,"topics":[],"score":227310,"global_rank":120200},{"name":"joshcamas/lightintensity","owner":"joshcamas","html_url":"https://github.com/joshcamas/lightintensity","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"A simple utility that allows for multiple systems to affect a light's intensity and shadow settings","topics":[],"score":227310,"global_rank":120250},{"name":"GregBahm/PokerVis","owner":"GregBahm","html_url":"https://github.com/GregBahm/PokerVis","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"Visualize the win probabilities of poker hands","topics":[],"score":227307,"global_rank":120271},{"name":"tawneeh/PierresTreats.Solution","owner":"tawneeh","html_url":"https://github.com/tawneeh/PierresTreats.Solution","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":null,"topics":[],"score":227306,"global_rank":120286},{"name":"NataliyaZhuravleva/PierreTreats.Solution","owner":"NataliyaZhuravleva","html_url":"https://github.com/NataliyaZhuravleva/PierreTreats.Solution","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":null,"topics":[],"score":227306,"global_rank":120289},{"name":"h-griffin/tower-defense","owner":"h-griffin","html_url":"https://github.com/h-griffin/tower-defense","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"C# 2D tower defense game using Unity","topics":["csharp","tower-defense-game","unity"],"score":227306,"global_rank":120323},{"name":"arturl/SF